WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Ryu guards DI at the wall.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.950
The blocked DI sends Ryu into the wall splat.

3
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.400
Crouching heavy punch connects.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.050
OD Swagger Step launches the juggle.

5
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.750
Standing heavy punch catches Ryu.

6
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.650
Light Arrow continues the juggle.
